  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed roof top stairwell and formation of a roof terrace with a glass balustrade by reason of its position, size, design and external appearance, would be an intrusive and inappropriate development, out of scale and character with this and neighbouring dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality, harming the appearance of the building and character of the Conservation Area, contrary to Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 and the NPPF.  ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed roof top stairwell and amenity space by reasons of its position, height and separation distance from neighbouring properties, would have a harmful effect on neighbour outlook, privacy; serious and adverse effect on the amenity enjoyed by occupants of neighbouring properties by reason of noise, disturbance, general activity contrary to Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1 and CC2 and the NPPF."
